    "detailed_description": "<h1>More From Jeff Winner</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>EvilTrap<br><br>Prepare for an unnerving adventure in EvilTrap, an open-world psychological survival horror game where every playthrough offers a fresh nightmare. Stranded on a desolate island, you'll face relentless supernatural threats as you scavenge for essential supplies and navigate a world teeming with danger.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1946060/extras/0afbfdcbd71d41d7b2792ef1ffe082cb.poster.avif?t=1740226823\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1946060/extras/0afbfdcbd71d41d7b2792ef1ffe082cb.webm?t=1740226823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1946060/extras/0afbfdcbd71d41d7b2792ef1ffe082cb.mp4?t=1740226823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Key Features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    Dynamic Horror Experience: Each game session is uniquely terrifying with 90% of jump scares being entirely random, ensuring that no two encounters are ever the same.<br><br></li><li>    Adaptive AI: The island\u2019s malevolent intelligence relentlessly tracks your progress, but it\u2019s not the only thing lurking in the shadows. Stay vigilant as both the environment and the AI adapt to your strategies.<br><br></li><li>    Survival Mechanics: To endure, you'll need to manage your hunger, find rest, and craft essential tools like traps and safe havens. Balance resource gathering with the constant threat of the unknown.<br><br></li><li>    Atmospheric Open World: Immerse yourself in a richly detailed and eerie environment. The island's vast, haunting landscapes are designed to keep you on edge as you uncover its dark secrets.</li></ul><br>EvilTrap challenges you to confront your fears in a world where every corner holds a new threat and survival depends on your ability to adapt and overcome.",
